BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wicker
DTSTART:20261024T231000Z
DTEND:20261025T011000Z
DTSTAMP:20261024T231000Z
UID:j2nMR4mbmu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nAn ostracized fisherwoman commis
 sions the local basketmaker to weave her a husband\, but when her wicker c
 reation proves unexpectedly extraordinary\, his presence ignites jealousy 
 and upheaval that threatens their quiet village. Q&A with Producer Brent 
 Stiefel following the Friday\, 10/23 7:30pm screening.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/wicker\n\nEstimated start: 16:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
